    <abstract>
        <para>The dataset is comprised of ad hoc records of animals seen dead on the road submitted primarily by members of the public (citizen scientists).</para>
    </abstract>
      <additionalInfo>
          <para>Additional information about the Project, and links to social media pages, can be found at www.projectsplatter.co.uk . Project Splatter is also available to answer any questions about the database.</para>
